> Romanian Diplomatic[ mission] in India. On this[ page] you will[ find] info on specific details[ such][ as] consulate contact information, web presence, cons[ular] office hours and[ directions][ to] the[ consulate]. The consulate[ in][ K]olkata is not[ the][ only][ diplomatic] representation of Romania[ in] India. On[ this][ page] you can also[ find] all other Romanian consulates located[ in] India.[
]The[ consulate][ of][ Romania] in Kolkata[ can] inform[ you] about[ the] scope of services they offer.
When[ you][ need] to find a[ place] to stay close to[ the][ Romanian] consulate we provide a handy hotel search box for[ accommodation] in a hotel or guest[house][ in] Kolkata[,] India.
