Ant[on][ovic] points out[ that] the[ device] is[ able][ to][ transfer][ injured][ people] in[ safety][,] protecting them[ from] falls[,] immersion[ and][ lateral] and[ vertical] impacts, confirming that, "The[ FR]OG-6 is also a safe and versatile transfer device in[ Med]evac (medical evacuation) mode."[
